WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.189
Lab 2 runs the same reachability
check against a test workspace,

2
00:00:04.189 --> 00:00:07.000
never production; the
authors haven't run it.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.871
Sign in to commercial Azure,

4
00:00:08.871 --> 00:00:12.775
add the log analytics extension,
run the check, and sign out.

5
00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:17.837
Every table should be delivering; each
late or missing one becomes a task.

6
00:00:17.837 --> 00:00:22.362
The reachability record supports continuous
monitoring and system monitoring.

7
00:00:22.362 --> 00:00:26.055
The dangers you saw: a missing
connector that looks healthy,

8
00:00:26.055 --> 00:00:30.500
a missed probe showing yesterday's
green, and a render filed as evidence.

9
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.410
Next, Chapter 4 deploys the workbook.
